[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the protective shield under the engine.</p><p>2. Remove the protective shield under the engine.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035864.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the protective shield\nunder the engine is not damaged.</p><p>1. Position the protective shield under the engine and tighten the\nrear bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>UNDE-ENGINE PROTECTION/GUARD</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Tighten the front bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>UNDE-ENGINE PROTECTION/GUARD</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>8.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the side bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035865.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Remove the vehicle from the\nlift.</p>"]]